                        "message":  "perf(du11): bound the declaration look-behind and cache per source text\n\nA whole-document prefix scan per head cost O(document) per declaration call; on a 210-page filing the reference pass took minutes. The look-behind is now a 64-character window and declarations are cached by source text identity (predecessors repeat across targets). 26ms -\u003e 3.7ms per uncached call, ~0 after the first scan of a unit; 105 focused tests and three-source recall unchanged.",
                        "timestamp":  "2026-10-18T11:20:34Z",
